[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
cloudtty has been installed.

Binary:     %%PREFIX%%/bin/cloudtty
Console:    %%PREFIX%%/libexec/cloudtty-console
Config:     %%PREFIX%%/etc/cloudtty/config.json.sample
PAM:        %%PREFIX%%/etc/pam.d/cloudtty
Examples:   %%PREFIX%%/share/examples/cloudtty/
Docs:       %%PREFIX%%/share/doc/cloudtty/

Quick enable on a VT (e.g. ttyv0):

  1. cp %%PREFIX%%/etc/cloudtty/config.json.sample \
        %%PREFIX%%/etc/cloudtty/config.json
  2. Append gettytab snippet from share/examples/cloudtty/gettytab.cloudtty
     to /etc/gettytab (if using getty lo= form), or set ttys to:
       ttyv0  "%%PREFIX%%/libexec/cloudtty-console"  xterm  on  secure
  3. kill -HUP 1

Font run-deps (spleen, dejavu, gnu-unifont) support en-US/fr-FR and broader
Unicode. Select a VT font after install, for example:

  vidcontrol -f %%PREFIX%%/share/fonts/spleen/spleen-8x16.fnt

Quiet boot knobs: see share/examples/cloudtty/loader.conf.cloudtty
EOM
}
]
